    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halley Mission: 2061\u00a0</strong>launches you into an epic sci-fi adventure among the stars! In this survival crafting RPG, you play as a retired astronaut called back into action for a top-secret mission near the perihelion of Halley's Comet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in the vast, desolate reaches of space, you'll face survival challenges like never before. Will you carefully ration your limited supplies, or use your ingenuity to build a fully functional space base and achieve self-sufficiency? Every decision matters \u2014 managing your resources and time wisely will be the key to completing your mission.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halley Mission: 2061\u00a0</strong>launches you into an epic sci-fi adventure among the stars! In this survival crafting RPG, you play as a retired astronaut called back into action for a top-secret mission near the perihelion of Halley's Comet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in the vast, desolate reaches of space, you'll face survival challenges like never before. Will you carefully ration your limited supplies, or use your ingenuity to build a fully functional space base and achieve self-sufficiency? Every decision matters \u2014 managing your resources and time wisely will be the key to completing your mission.</p>",
